WEBVTT

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:16.400
(glass smashes)

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.280
(glass smashes)

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.000
(glass smashing)

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:30.680
(growls)

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:45.240
Things are not quite what
they appear, Credence...

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.240
no matter what you've been told.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.480
(inhales sharply)

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.760
My name is Aurelius.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.560
He's lied to you.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.960
Kindled your hate.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:56.400
(grunting)

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:03.840
(thump)

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:07.600
(melancholy music playing)

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.560
(sighs)

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:19.840
(wind whooshing)

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.040
(phoenix cries)

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:35.000
(melancholy music continues)

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.080
(phoenix cries)

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.640
What he's told you isn't true...

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.840
but we do share the same blood.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.640
You are a Dumbledore.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.640
(emotional music playing)

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.040
(grunts softly)

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.400
I'm sorry for your pain.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.600
We didn't know, I promise.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.960
(people murmuring)

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.760
NO ENTRANCE! ACCESS PROHIBITED!

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.760
(clanking)

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:08.800
(snoring softly)

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:10.280
(object thudding)

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:11.680
(exhales heavily)

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.520
(Newt) I've come to see my brother.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.440
His name is Theseus Scamander.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.920
(thudding)

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.280
Sorry, that's, uh...

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:30.600
Wand.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:41.640
(squeaks)

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.240
(chitters)

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.240
Oh, that's, uh...

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:48.520
I'm... I'm a magizoologist.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:50.640
He's perfectly harmless. He's...

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.040
He's just a pet, really.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.840
(squeaking)

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.520
-(blows raspberries) -Sorry.

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:57.960
(Teddy sniffing)

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.480
That's Teddy.

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:02.280
He's a total nightmare,
truth be told.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.800
They stay here.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.720
(Pick squeals)

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.520
(larvae squeaking)

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.120
(rattling)

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.960
(stridulating)

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.800
So, how will I know
where to find him?

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:28.720
He's your brother?

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:30.920
Yes.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.520
He will be the one who
looks like your brother.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.160
(Pick squeaking)

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:39.360
I will be back, Pick.

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.000
On my word.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.680
(warden) "I'll be back, Pick.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.880
"On my word." (laughs)

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:54.200
And I'll be Minister
of Magic one day.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.120
(laughs)

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.000
(sniffing)

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:01.240
-(blows raspberries) -(laughs)

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.000
(groans)

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.640
(grand music playing)

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:06.680
(crowd cheering)

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.520
(screeches)

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.720
(mysterious music playing)

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.320
-(breathes deeply) -Take
us 'round the back.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.520
It's not safe here.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.560
No.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:38.120
Roll it down.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:39.680
What?

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.880
The window.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.240
Roll it down.

